  "body": "### Summary\nLOT-056 (#82, PR #261) needs this state captured, to verify the image-host adapter table instead of relying on what the legacy code does.\n\nState: a real upload to the rehost (success) and one with a wrong key. OPERATOR DECISION NEEDED: this uses the project's API key and publishes an image on a third-party host. Do not run it before the operator says go.\n\nAcceptance criteria\n- Captured request and answer, anonymized, with a MANIFEST row.\n- docs/HFR-PROTOCOL.md §6c, LOT-056 subsection: the row is moved from 'code' to 'verified'.",
